{"id":"1c77a2d71bd8704e","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-mapping-class-group.md","title":"Mapping Class Group","display":"df-mapping-class-group — Mapping Class Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-mapping-class-group","aliases":["58-df-mapping-class-group","MCG","Mapping Class Group"],"display":"df-mapping-class-group — Mapping Class Group","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-surface.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-atlas.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-plane-orientation.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-mapping-class-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-mapping-class-group</span><span>MCG</span><span>Mapping Class Group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mapping-class-group — Mapping Class Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"07a09ca243e6c6a3\" href=\"?note=07a09ca243e6c6a3\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-surface.md\">../batch03/58-df-surface.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d530952583f9f96d\" href=\"?note=d530952583f9f96d\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-atlas.md\">../batch05/58-df-atlas.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1bab78124334e27a\" href=\"?note=1bab78124334e27a\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-plane-orientation.md\">../batch03/58-df-plane-orientation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,\\Sigma,\\tau,o,h,h&#39;,A,B\\in V\">\\(G,\\Sigma,\\tau,o,h,h&#39;,A,B\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=[0,1]\">\\(I=[0,1]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_I=\\{U\\subseteq I:\\forall t\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;((t-\\varepsilon,t+\\varepsilon)\\cap I\\subseteq U)\\}\">\\(\\tau_I=\\{U\\subseteq I:\\forall t\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;((t-\\varepsilon,t+\\varepsilon)\\cap I\\subseteq U)\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\Sigma\\times I}=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau,I,\\tau_I)\">\\(\\tau_{\\Sigma\\times I}=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau,I,\\tau_I)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrientedSurfaceAtlas}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrientedSurfaceAtlas}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\)</span> 使用依赖文件中的定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrientedSurfacePresentation}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{OrientedSurfacePresentation}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrientationPreservingHomeomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{OrientationPreservingHomeomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MappingClassIsotopy}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{MappingClassIsotopy}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MappingClassGroup}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{MappingClassGroup}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> 是下述定义的谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}^+(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}^+(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\)</span> 是自同胚集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[h]_{\\Sigma,\\tau,o}\">\\([h]_{\\Sigma,\\tau,o}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MappingClassProduct}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\">\\(\\mathrm{MappingClassProduct}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\)</span> 是下述给出的等价类及乘法图。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 仍只表示商集载体，不改为新的结构元组。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\sim_{\\mathrm{iso}}h&#39;\">\\(h\\sim_{\\mathrm{iso}}h&#39;\\)</span> 是固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\tau,o\">\\(\\Sigma,\\tau,o\\)</span> 后的二元兼容记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oriented\\text{-}surface\\text{-}presentation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrientedSurfacePresentation}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{OrientedSurfaceAtlas}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau,o).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oriented\\text{-}surface\\text{-}presentation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrientedSurfacePresentation}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{OrientedSurfaceAtlas}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau,o).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orientation\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}homeomorphism}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{OrientationPreservingHomeomorphism}_S(h;\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{OrientedSurfacePresentation}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\n\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(h,\\Sigma,\\tau,\\Sigma,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in o\\;\n\\forall\\langle U&#39;,W&#39;,\\psi\\rangle\\in o\\;\n\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_S\\!\\left(\n(\\psi\\circ h\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap h^{-1}[U&#39;]]\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orientation\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}homeomorphism}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{OrientationPreservingHomeomorphism}_S(h;\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{OrientedSurfacePresentation}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\n\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(h,\\Sigma,\\tau,\\Sigma,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in o\\;\n\\forall\\langle U&#39;,W&#39;,\\psi\\rangle\\in o\\;\n\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_S\\!\\left(\n(\\psi\\circ h\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap h^{-1}[U&#39;]]\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}class\\text{-}homeomorphisms}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Homeo}^+(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\coloneqq\n\\{h\\in\\Sigma^\\Sigma:\\mathrm{OrientationPreservingHomeomorphism}_S(h;\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}class\\text{-}homeomorphisms}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Homeo}^+(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\coloneqq\n\\{h\\in\\Sigma^\\Sigma:\\mathrm{OrientationPreservingHomeomorphism}_S(h;\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}class\\text{-}isotopy\\text{-}relation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MappingClassIsotopy}_S(h,h&#39;,\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\leftrightarrow\nh,h&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Homeo}^+(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists H\\in\\Sigma^{\\Sigma\\times I}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,\\Sigma\\times I,\\tau_{\\Sigma\\times I},\\Sigma,\\tau)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma\\;(H(\\langle x,0\\rangle)=h(x)\\land H(\\langle x,1\\rangle)=h&#39;(x))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\n\\bigl(\\{\\langle x,H(\\langle x,t\\rangle)\\rangle:x\\in\\Sigma\\}\\in\\mathrm{Homeo}^+(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}class\\text{-}isotopy\\text{-}relation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MappingClassIsotopy}_S(h,h&#39;,\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\leftrightarrow\nh,h&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Homeo}^+(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists H\\in\\Sigma^{\\Sigma\\times I}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,\\Sigma\\times I,\\tau_{\\Sigma\\times I},\\Sigma,\\tau)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma\\;(H(\\langle x,0\\rangle)=h(x)\\land H(\\langle x,1\\rangle)=h&#39;(x))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\n\\bigl(\\{\\langle x,H(\\langle x,t\\rangle)\\rangle:x\\in\\Sigma\\}\\in\\mathrm{Homeo}^+(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}class\\text{-}isotopy}\\vdash\nh\\sim_{\\mathrm{iso}}h&#39;\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MappingClassIsotopy}_S(h,h&#39;,\\Sigma,\\tau,o).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}class\\text{-}isotopy}\\vdash\nh\\sim_{\\mathrm{iso}}h&#39;\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MappingClassIsotopy}_S(h,h&#39;,\\Sigma,\\tau,o).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}class\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n[h]_{\\Sigma,\\tau,o}\\coloneqq\n\\{g\\in\\mathrm{Homeo}^+(\\Sigma,\\tau,o):\\mathrm{MappingClassIsotopy}_S(h,g,\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}class\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n[h]_{\\Sigma,\\tau,o}\\coloneqq\n\\{g\\in\\mathrm{Homeo}^+(\\Sigma,\\tau,o):\\mathrm{MappingClassIsotopy}_S(h,g,\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}class\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MappingClassProduct}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle[h]_{\\Sigma,\\tau,o},[g]_{\\Sigma,\\tau,o}\\rangle,\n[h\\circ g]_{\\Sigma,\\tau,o}\\right\\rangle:\nh,g\\in\\mathrm{Homeo}^+(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}class\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MappingClassProduct}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle[h]_{\\Sigma,\\tau,o},[g]_{\\Sigma,\\tau,o}\\rangle,\n[h\\circ g]_{\\Sigma,\\tau,o}\\right\\rangle:\nh,g\\in\\mathrm{Homeo}^+(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}class\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MappingClassGroup}_S(G,\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{OrientedSurfacePresentation}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\n\\land G=\\{[h]_{\\Sigma,\\tau,o}:h\\in\\mathrm{Homeo}^+(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathrm{MappingClassProduct}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau,o),G\\times G,G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}class\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MappingClassGroup}_S(G,\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{OrientedSurfacePresentation}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\n\\land G=\\{[h]_{\\Sigma,\\tau,o}:h\\in\\mathrm{Homeo}^+(\\Sigma,\\tau,o)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathrm{MappingClassProduct}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau,o),G\\times G,G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>同痕等价关系仅在定向保持自同胚集合上取商；乘法由复合诱导，其良定义条件已写入断言。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 仍是原有商集载体。没有把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的编码替换成包含乘法或单位元的新元组。</li>\n<li>本文件不再依赖 “with multiplication” 或切片 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H(-,t)\">\\(H(-,t)\\)</span> 的文字解释来确定群运算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Farb and Margalit, A Primer on Mapping Class Groups</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-surface.md","status":"resolved","id":"07a09ca243e6c6a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-surface.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-atlas.md","status":"resolved","id":"d530952583f9f96d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":